{"metas":[{"id":"tt22042292","type":"series","name":"11 Minutes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//6tGsPlNcqDlduY267EP5jMRFnff.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/efp1RjvoOBidQg6wVdSxF7kIsaN.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnD3lygVLYM7eGZL2KZQrPl5Rl.png","description":"A four-part documentary that takes viewers inside the heart-stopping stories of terror and survival experienced by those who were at the 2017 Route 91 Harvest Music Festival in Las Vegas.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tmdb:210805","type":"series","name":"Tyler Perry's Zatima","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//mccoy3vzuTHucJXkBL27SqcyAvv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6Vtd3EMdOuoT3GIUKDbkDzSFp0Q.jpg","description":"Zac and Fatima take a huge step to strengthen their bond, but new friends and past actions interfere with their blossoming relationship.","releaseInfo":"2022","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bI5PIWGObVSoJGV30o9GrMTav7.png"},{"id":"tt21929812","type":"series","name":"My Dream Quinceañera","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//4UHdgwsRU4WIGYyF8KaNNeMXmyh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mAz69jZz3s1oX6jRFojWCQ6XLnJ.jpg","description":"Three Southern Californian teens – Bayle Delgado, Romi Herrada and Angelica Luna – go through simultaneous fun and drama-filled journeys to celebrate the coming-of-age birthday parties of their dreams while expert quinceañera planner Maria Perez helps make all their quince wishes come true.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tmdb:203489","type":"series","name":"Mike Judge's Beavis and Butt-Head","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//75am8jsmRHHcpIPkm4RyrMn851A.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rAUxCUyroOvjbTYZDXaRLJRoVHr.jpg","description":"Two teenage heavy-metal music fans occasionally do idiotic things because they're bored. For them, everything is \"cool\" or \"sucks.\"","releaseInfo":"2022","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caRCqMwsn7vJTvlo3u4FSv59KEl.png"},{"id":"tt20859150","type":"series","name":"All Star Shore","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//eT8BpxEIJqbBRztWBloHMKfO0bv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/a3GkJoNy0EJ8rvrjXPYinE6iQrs.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b8laye06F8yQTMVAxftxcC3rSa.png","description":"14 of the world’s biggest reality superstars from some of television’s most iconic series – “Jersey Shore,” “Love Is Blind,” “RuPaul’s Drag Race,” “Geordie Shore,” “Acapulco Shore,” “Rio Shore,” and “Bachelor in Paradise” – come together for an epic vacation at the ultimate shore house in the Canary Islands, to battle it out for a cash prize and global bragging rights.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt20833496","type":"series","name":"Hip Hop My House","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//oJrNJnTSfFbnCpSRjlspoDu5dZr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/smkzCnjaYA9Uvx3DisOYG47FHsU.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbriEoIYkZOhaW6FVRjYTPgb48p.png","description":"Harlem rapper Cam’ron brings his iconic style to this high-octane hip-hop makeover series with the help of interior designer Zeez Louize. Together they spin one lucky superfan’s crib into a larger-than-life tribute to rap icons, past and present.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt15314636","type":"series","name":"Players","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//n0YH9RlBidJNsSnPmRsV4AqK2m4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iVUyHxuwWRtTw0kmfHA2E2WVlQZ.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3w2BYB27cRfQ05tvUXudF8OTBJ.png","description":"A pro League of Legends esports team pursues their first championship after years of close calls and heartache. To win it all, they will need their prodigy, a 17-year-old rookie, and their 27-year-old veteran to put their egos aside and work together.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt18271996","type":"series","name":"Yo! MTV Raps","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//3Y2B1WhxHFKlEdmkT7hiDDmY810.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/gbjtpQVzvHKMWwKJQmO4GrCvtlB.jpg","description":"A comprehensive deep dive into the current state of hip hop, with hosted segments from renowned battle rapper Conceited and celebrated deejay DJ Diamond Kuts, live performances, cyphers and lifestyle content.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt19853304","type":"series","name":"Black Gold","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ooHUE1RkyonmxHQtcUiHlRzZeWD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ga6gPXEJ9uAfCBGCkC0YzncfW8b.jpg","description":"The story of the coverup of the century: of the boss atop a trillion dollar industry who discovered a shocking truth 40 years ago, created a black ops campaign to hide the evidence, and stopped at nothing to keep the money flowing, as the world burned.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt19895990","type":"series","name":"Never Seen Again","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//kmrBPFDAJQVissiHT1xuQr9OlMz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fdwLta1BJXH7vgyqmLbh3sscPAT.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vflUicB7fkpBYvA70uD6oUrgvBZ.png","description":"Docuseries told from the point of view of those left behind after a loved one vanishes without a trace.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt0206512","type":"series","name":"SpongeBob SquarePants","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p184854_b_v8_bj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/f3f5OzzYd8m3zN47DAjKs0sbx00.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imM7dqtVl070IIKyOqzOHmHFXqq.png","description":""},{"id":"tt12915960","type":"series","name":"The Patrick Star Show","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/mKjU_UncKu5b8JxiCbWlMTgVRAA=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvUlRUVjk3MjY1NS53ZWJw","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kP